      "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> An enemy moves within Otehika's reach</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> Otehika swings their weapon as close to their enemy as they can without touching them, immediately attempting a Demoralize check. On a success, the enemy is Off-Guard until the beginning of their next turn.</p>",
